commit 45bb5c9fde4d15ee698f42a6e5f9304aae336ff5
Author: AgilePlus Ops <ops@phenotype.local>
Date:   Wed Oct 14 02:30:40 2026 -0700

    docs(deny): explain benign advisory-not-detected for glib ignore entry
    
    cargo-deny on a macOS host emits advisory-not-detected for the
    RUSTSEC-2024-0429 ignore entry because glib enters the tree only via
    libappindicator -> tray-icon -> tauri, a Linux-only path (macOS uses muda
    directly). On ubuntu, which is what CI runs, the crate matches and the
    ignore is required. Records that distinction so a future agent does not
    delete the entry based on a local macOS warning.
    
    tx-agent: jcode
    tx-validated: manual
    tx-scope: ci/deny-docs
    tx-intent: prevent removal of a required ignore entry due to host-target artifact
    tx-task: fix-dead-audit-toml
    tx-parent: e1c8b3e9

